# beatmania (DJ Main): boot -> attract -> 2 coins -> 1P start -> the turntable
# picks "skip" at the practice-stage prompt -> sound select (hip-hop) -> the
# song "u gotta groove" played with a fixed pattern of keys and scratches (it
# fails) -> continue countdown -> game over -> attract. Checks the inputs, the
# turntable and gameplay against MAME frame by frame.
game bm1stmix

hash ram  0x400000 0x410000     # 68EC020 work RAM
hash obj  0x801000 0x801800     # sprite list
hash pal  0x480000 0x484440     # palette

at 4500 mark coin
at 4500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4530 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4600 press "1 Player Start" 12

# practice stage? turn the turntable towards "skip", then confirm

at 5260 set "TT1/Dial" 252
at 5261 set "TT1/Dial" 248
at 5262 set "TT1/Dial" 244
